{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cbbeb5834997d74dbc44264f04660c2bf84077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> the expanded fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/2/3a2731abbb0e2524327bba81e355d6d886e5a6cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7df2a2820c91b2018f414650b4b450f63a6c5b95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.373737\\cdots$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />, and the expanded fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2df9f6e3dec58d5d04c5ac6f07d69f427df8923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53b6384e2599da56345e7f2fa8059daf4e7a3bb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.737373\\cdots$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />. In base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5f6500d904b18c0eaf34da49a31bd3fb72d7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/2/3a2731abbb0e2524327bba81e355d6d886e5a6cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />, when expanded, becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/2461bc5b05406a08cc10f947e8038c8e24068340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.252525\\cdots$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />, while the fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2df9f6e3dec58d5d04c5ac6f07d69f427df8923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f2211bb496e881959e2454512545b84737ac414.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.525252\\cdots$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" />. The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cbbeb5834997d74dbc44264f04660c2bf84077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca5f6500d904b18c0eaf34da49a31bd3fb72d7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />, each written in the base ten, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8eaa22e9d1492dc678f0befda7eb422b982dd61a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 24 \\quad \\text{(B) } 22 \\quad \\text{(C) } 21 \\quad \\text{(D) } 20 \\quad \\text{(E) } 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"309\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, let's write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/2/3a2731abbb0e2524327bba81e355d6d886e5a6cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> as a proper fraction in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cbbeb5834997d74dbc44264f04660c2bf84077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />. To do that, note that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cdd629bd51e555c6cc76f6e1548fcaf565609e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1=0.373737\\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" />\nMultiplying this equation on both sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50c811bc41e0c2fde733b0519a02047535f78d89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"21\" />, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/871d10f155a2f149979c964941759919942429b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1^2F_1=37.373737\\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"172\" height=\"21\" />\nSubtracting the first equation from the second one, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bfcde8ca51e02caac7f90522de597e3e19dac1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1^2F_1-F_1=37\\\\F_1(R_1^2-1)=37\\\\F_1=\\frac{3R_1+7}{R_1^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"84\" />\nUsing a very similar method as above, we can see that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9af2493ce3a530dfe6bbff978e0fd0d003eb74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1=\\frac{3R_1+7}{R_1^2-1}=\\frac{2R_2+5}{R_2^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"201\" height=\"43\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/f/84fcbc6fbab3fde5316729ecc5b750231fd0b727.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_2=\\frac{7R_1+3}{R_1^2-1}=\\frac{5R_2+2}{R_2^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"201\" height=\"43\" />.\nDividing the 2 equations to get some potential solutions, we get (note that we don't have to worry about division by zero because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/8/61845bab87c9b19d41d96afdaa8a9db823be5e2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1,R_2&gt;7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/8297f1ecf00089b561241cc86890d53004ac7b92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3R_1+7}{7R_1+3}=\\frac{2R_2+5}{5R_2+2}\\\\15R_1R_2+6R_1+35R_2+14=14R_1R_2+35R_1+6R_2+15\\\\R_1R_2-29R_1+29R_2=1\\\\\\left(R_1+29\\right)\\left(R_2-29\\right)=-840$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"100\" />\nSince non-integer bases are rarely used, we can try to assume that the solution is positive integers and see if we get any solutions.\nNotice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d5683d39bef15d5152f8b2226606796c4bd3b617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(R_2-29)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" /> has to be a negative factor of 840. We need to plug in values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/d/fad6b440c2f7e082ccb3aacef37ca6862ea1081e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2 &gt; 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"17\" />. 840 divides -21, so we plug in 8 to check. Luckily, when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/e/b4e4f12896c05bfa863745de340ef0ef83b5b99c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"17\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95ab43c42caf2d6228f26173f875965f43d6a496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R_1=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"17\" />, and furthermore, 11+8=19 is one of the answers. We can quickly test it into the original equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9af2493ce3a530dfe6bbff978e0fd0d003eb74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1=\\frac{3R_1+7}{R_1^2-1}=\\frac{2R_2+5}{R_2^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"201\" height=\"43\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/f/84fcbc6fbab3fde5316729ecc5b750231fd0b727.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_2=\\frac{7R_1+3}{R_1^2-1}=\\frac{5R_2+2}{R_2^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"201\" height=\"43\" />, and we see they indeed work. Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be60d0ae6d1813c8b82208f20b91e0e03d7b3eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(E)19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"60\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~ Minor edits by Raghav(AOPS - CatalanThinker)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title